{"product_id":"pro-life-answers-to-pro-choice-arguments-expanded-updated","title":"Pro-Life Answers to Pro-Choice Arguments Expanded \u0026 Updated","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs politicians, citizens, and families continue the raging national debate on whether it's proper to end human life in the womb, resources like Randy Alcorn's Prolife Answers to Prochoice Arguments have proven invaluable. With over 75,000 copies in print, this revised and updated guide offers timely information and inspiration from a \"sanctity of life\" perspective. Real answers to real questions about abortion appear in logical and concise form. The final chapter -- \"Fifty Ways to Help Unborn Babies and Their Mothers\"-- is worth the price of this book alone!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 209\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Randy Alcorn\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781576737514\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 455\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45684522483865,"sku":"2RD9781576737514","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68b310658be0e_Pro-Life_Answers_to_Pro-Choice_Arguments_Expanded___Updated_Randy_Alcorn.jpg?v=1756576923","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/pro-life-answers-to-pro-choice-arguments-expanded-updated","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}